@startuml
title Serviqo - Module 9: Worker Recommendation System (Proposed)

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor Customer
actor "Serviqo Web or Mobile Client" as Client
actor "Recruiter AI Agent" as RecruiterAI
actor "Serviqo Central Backend" as Backend

rectangle "Serviqo Worker Recommendation System (Not Implemented)" {
  usecase "Request worker\nrecommendations" as RequestRecommendations
  usecase "Analyze service-request\nrequirements" as AnalyzeRequirements
  usecase "Retrieve relevant\nworker profile information" as RetrieveProfiles
  usecase "Match workers to\nservice requirements" as MatchWorkers
  usecase "Rank suitable workers" as RankWorkers
  usecase "Present recommended\nworkers to customer" as PresentRecommendations
  usecase "Provide recommendation\nfeedback" as ProvideFeedback
  usecase "Use feedback and interaction\ndata to improve recommendations" as ImproveRecommendations
}

Customer -- RequestRecommendations
Customer -- ProvideFeedback
Client -- RequestRecommendations
Client -- PresentRecommendations
Client -- ProvideFeedback

RequestRecommendations ..> AnalyzeRequirements : <<include>>
RequestRecommendations ..> RetrieveProfiles : <<include>>
RequestRecommendations ..> MatchWorkers : <<include>>
MatchWorkers ..> RankWorkers : <<include>>
RequestRecommendations ..> PresentRecommendations : <<include>>
ProvideFeedback ..> ImproveRecommendations : <<include>>

AnalyzeRequirements -- RecruiterAI
MatchWorkers -- RecruiterAI
RankWorkers -- RecruiterAI
ImproveRecommendations -- RecruiterAI
RetrieveProfiles -- Backend
ImproveRecommendations -- Backend

note right of RankWorkers
Planned ranking attributes include
skills, experience, location,
ratings, and availability.
end note

note bottom of ImproveRecommendations
Feedback and interaction data must be
relevant to recommendations and handled
under applicable privacy and access rules.
end note

note bottom of RequestRecommendations
This is a proposed AI-assisted feature.
No worker-recommendation AI agent or
recommendation endpoint is implemented yet.
end note

@enduml
